@startuml 图2-31 鲁棒图：报表与对账（UC-16 用例实现 · 参与者：运营管理员）
' 依据：需求规格说明书用例清单；代码 apps/api/internal/httpserver 与 repo（2026-11-26）
' 鲁棒图非 UML 标准图：边界类只连 actor/控制类，实体类只连控制类。
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2E5C8A
}

actor "运营管理员" as U

boundary "对账页\nAdminReconcilePage" as B1
boundary "报表页\nAdminReportPage" as B2
boundary "导出页\nExportPage" as B3

control "对账控制器\nReconcileController" as C1
control "报表聚合器\nReportAggregator" as C2
control "导出器\nExporter" as C3

entity "积分账户 PointAccount" as E1
entity "积分流水 PointTxn" as E2
entity "积分批次 PointBatch" as E3
entity "批次流水 PointBatchTxn" as E4
entity "兑换订单 RedeemOrder" as E5
entity "碳记录 CarbonRecord" as E6

' ---------- 主成功场景与主要备选流 ----------
U --> B1 : 触发积分对账
B1 --> C1 : reconcile()
C1 --> E1 : 读全部账户余额
C1 --> E2 : 按账户汇总流水
C1 --> E3 : 汇总 ACTIVE 批次剩余
C1 --> E4 : 汇总批次消耗/回填
C1 --> B1 : 返回 ok / mismatches
U --> B2 : 查看运营报表
B2 --> C2 : daily / category / merchant
C2 --> E5 : 聚合兑换订单
C2 --> E6 : 聚合碳减排
U --> B3 : 导出报表
B3 --> C3 : export(format)
C3 --> E2 : 读取明细数据

note bottom of C1
  **实现状态：对账已实现，报表/导出未实现**。
  GET /admin/points/reconcile 只校验 balance == Σ(point_txn.amount)；
  不校验批次守恒；报表与导出页属目标态。
end note

legend right
  边界类：B1–B3　控制类：C1–C3　实体类：E1–E6
  对账口径以流水为准，批次差值单独列为 TODO
endlegend

@enduml
